flowchart TD
    A[Agent proposes an action] --> B[Canonical request
identity • tool • resource • purpose • limit • workflow]
    B --> C[Trusted context
resource state • policy version • approved risk source]
    C --> D[Deterministic policy kernel]
    D -->|ALLOW| E[Scoped capability
request hash • nonce • expiry • one use]
    D -->|ESCALATE| F[Human review queue]
    D -->|DENY / FREEZE| G[Refusal evidence]
    E --> H[Independent gateway]
    H --> I[Protected-tool adapter]
    I --> J[Execution receipt]
    F --> K[Bounded review decision]
    K --> L[Fresh request required]
    H --> M[Authority evidence ledger]
    J --> M
    G --> M
    K --> M
    M --> N[Transactional outbox]
    N --> O[Event stream]
    O --> P[Analytics and advisory intelligence]
    P --> Q[Policy-quality recommendation]
    Q -. policy author approval required .-> D
    R[Operational signals
replay • burst • adapter error] --> S[Increase friction only]
    S --> D
